title Dynamic View: Software System

actor <<Person>>\nUser as User
participant <<Container>>\nWeb Application as Web Application
participant <<Container>>\nMessage Bus as Message Bus
participant <<Container>>\nApp 1 as App 1
participant <<Container>>\nApp 2 as App 2

User->Web Application: Updates details
Web Application->Message Bus: Sends update event
Message Bus->App 1: Broadcasts update event
Message Bus->App 2: Broadcasts update event
